'''twink'''<sup>2</sup> (twingk), ''v. t.'' [Imitative; cf. ''tink''<sup>1</sup> and ''twank.''] To pour out in bird-notes; twitter; chirp.
{{smaller block|<poem>As a swallow in the air doth sing
